{"kind":"event","event_id":8593,"event_uid":"01M2Q2V9D2NMNH1AR8ZYS1MYMZ","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":355,"issue_uid":"01M2Q2R4D1DJ6E6X6PBJHK346H","issue_short_id":"346h","actor":"impl:2@run-30","hlc_physical_ms":1789628622242,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"67f09fa2691de927949bdc603b65c61267ad953431e8c1ce2f83a2e17b119c2b","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q2V9D1YEG5M6AP3ZM29T50","author":"impl:2@run-30","body":"Task 2 approach: add readSyncOrigin() to client/src/storeData.ts (window.__TINYAPP_SYNC__, accepted only as a string starting ws:// or wss://, undefined outside a browser), declare the handle in vite-env.d.ts beside the seed and exam flag, add syncUrl(module) to client/src/config.ts built on it with SERVER left byte-for-byte as it was, point SyncLink at syncUrl('todos'), widen createTodosStore's exposeStore condition by the third mode, and name the handle in AGENTS.md's key-files list. Not writing client/test/sync-origin.test.ts — the Proof's Test: path is the peer's exam.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:03:42.241182519Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:03:42.242Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":8594,"event_uid":"01M2Q2W96FKA0SHP5BH4MZYF35","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":354,"issue_uid":"01M2Q2R0757ZBXZ6W30STP4T0J","issue_short_id":"4t0j","actor":"impl:1@run-30","hlc_physical_ms":1789628654799,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"bb062b48edafefe9fc346910702e0edf1b594e80a5f46af2c17eb94ddd895137","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q2W96CJH35P142GXHRZ2SN","author":"impl:1@run-30","body":"Approach: lift server/test/celld.ts into packages/tinyapp-exam/src/celld.ts behaviour-for-behaviour, adding the serverDir/budgetMb parameters and the two rejections M1 asks for (exit-before-ready carrying code+stderr, and a readyMs timeout naming the budget and killing the child). New src/surface.ts holds examSurface(url) over the root's six verbs plus a generic call() so leg (d)'s unknown-verb 404 has a path. index.ts re-exports startCelld/examSurface/types. server/test/celld.ts is deleted and the two server tests re-point their import to 'tinyapp-exam' with serverDir = join(import.meta.dir, '..'), keeping the child-process form. Watching for one risk: server/tsconfig typechecks test/*.ts under workers-types+ES2022 lib, and importing the package barrel pulls browser.ts et al into that program — checking that first.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:04:14.796465162Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:04:14.799Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":8595,"event_uid":"01M2Q2WFN56H802FFEFWAAYNZX","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":355,"issue_uid":"01M2Q2R4D1DJ6E6X6PBJHK346H","issue_short_id":"346h","actor":"exam:2@run-30","hlc_physical_ms":1789628661413,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"df30256de8083ff0ef7957f6916cfb050e545b385770c2acd39776c55fe89e05","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q2WFN4QN9K7MYRVWWZHDNQ","author":"exam:2@run-30","body":"examiner (task 2, exam round 1): writing client/test/sync-origin.test.ts as a single happy-dom file following client/test/exam-page.test.ts's shape (guarded GlobalRegistrator.register, counting stubs for reconnecting-websocket / ../src/sqlite / the two TinyBase factories, a 25 ms drain in afterAll). readSyncOrigin and syncUrl are reached through dynamic module objects (await import) rather than named static imports, so at BASE each leg fails as 'not a function' — the absent implementation — instead of the whole file failing to load. Leg (a) drives readSyncOrigin over the six undefined cases including globalThis.window swapped to undefined and restored in a finally; legs (b)-(d) render the app's own Store under each mode and read the URL the reconnecting-websocket stub was constructed with; leg (e) reads AGENTS.md's Key Files section and applies the first Run: line's ordering regex. The two other Run: lines (the vite-env declaration, SERVER unchanged) are asserted too, as M1's and M2's remaining clauses.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:04:21.412398404Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:04:21.413Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":8665,"event_uid":"01M2Q30NB5ASDEYGKP2GHXYHEN","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":355,"issue_uid":"01M2Q2R4D1DJ6E6X6PBJHK346H","issue_short_id":"346h","actor":"impl:2@run-30","hlc_physical_ms":1789628798309,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"22ed435cda1b6f6066be2f2541c52da94d3d1d3927e27e5673c7d821e3b24217","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2Q30NB4CMQGB85FZX8KFZGD","author":"impl:2@run-30","body":"Landed at 0f2d5ff. All seven PROOFS green on a clean tree.\n\nTwo notes a later session would otherwise rediscover:\n\n1. `bun run typecheck` needs `server/generated/facets.ts`, which is gitignored and written by `bun run --cwd server build:facets`. On a fresh clone the Check fails with TS2307 on `./generated/facets` before it ever reaches client code — run build:facets first. Nothing in this task touches the server; the artifact is a build product and stays out of the diff.\n\n2. `readSyncOrigin()` reads the handle on every call rather than capturing it at import, because `syncUrl` is called from the synchronizer factory and the exam sets `window.__TINYAPP_SYNC__` after `config.ts` has been imported. Effectively still once-at-mount for a real page, as the Context asks.\n\nRehearsed legs (b), (c) and (d) locally against a throwaway happy-dom render file modelled on `client/test/exam-page.test.ts` (socket URL captured off the `reconnecting-websocket` stub, store identity against the Provider's, socket count zero for the seeded and flagged pages); deleted it before committing, since `client/test/sync-origin.test.ts` is the peer's. The four existing client exams still pass unchanged.","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:06:38.308132997Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T07:06:38.309Z"}
